<title>GERMANY: German Q4 GDP flat vs Q3, up 1.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>German Q4 GDP flat vs Q3, up 1.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p>PAN-GERMAN GDP Q4 96 Q3 96 Q2 96</p>
<p> qtr/qtr	     unch	   +0.5	   +1.5</p>
<p> yr/yr		 +1.9	   +2.3	   +1.1</p>
<p>W.GERMAN GDP</p>
<p> yr/yr		 +1.8	   +2.2	   +0.9</p>
<p>E.GERMAN GDP</p>
<p> yr/yr		 +2.8	   +3.4	   +2.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Quarter-on-quarter figures are adjusted for inflation (1991 prices) and for seasonal and calendar factors. They are rounded to a half pct point. Yr/yr changes are adjusted for inflation but not seasonal or calendar factors.</p>
</text>
